      "title": "California investigates Nvidia over whether chip exports ended up in China",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/20/california-investigates-nvidia-over-whether-chip-exports-ended-up-in-china",
      "description": "<p>State attorney says scandal ‘raises bright red flags’ and aims to find out if company misled investors</p><p>California has served an investigative subpoena on Nvidia after a scandal that <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/12/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-resigns\">prompted the departure</a> of co-founder and longtime chief executive Jensen Huang.</p><p>Rob Bonta, the US state’s attorney general, issued the subpoena as part of an investigation into whether exports of the California-based company’s advanced semiconductor chips ended up in China, contravening US restrictions.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/20/california-investigates-nvidia-over-whether-chip-exports-ended-up-in-china\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-20T09:18:30"
    },
    {
      "title": "California AG subpoenas Nvidia over worries about Huang’s ties with China",
      "link": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/20/california-ag-subpoenas-nvidia-over-worries-about-huangs-ties-with-china/",
      "description": "\"The conduct of Nvidia and its former CEO raises bright red flags, including about the ways in which the company may have misled investors,\" California AG Rob Bonta said.",
